{"id":"22e131802ba82e06","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-prikry.md","title":"Prikry Forcing","display":"thm-prikry — Prikry Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-prikry","aliases":["58-thm-prikry"],"display":"thm-prikry — Prikry Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-measurable]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-prikry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-prikry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prikry — Prikry Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"58-df-measurable\">58-df-measurable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (measurable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"58-df-measurable\">58-df-measurable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (normal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete nonprincipal ultrafilter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_U,\\leq_U,\\mathbb P_U\">\\(P_U,\\leq_U,\\mathbb P_U\\)</span> (conditions, extension order, and Prikry forcing poset defined in the antecedent)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> (measurable-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"58-df-measurable\">58-df-measurable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}\">\\(\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}\\)</span> (the ambient forcing relation for the set-sized poset <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P_U\">\\(\\mathbb P_U\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f:S\\to\\kappa\\;\\left(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(f^{-1}[\\{\\beta\\}]\\in U)\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land P_U=\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in P_U\\;\\left(\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_U\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow s\\subseteq t\\land B\\subseteq A\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathbb P_U=\\langle P_U,\\leq_U\\rangle\\end{aligned}\\right]\\to\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}\\mathrm{cf}(\\check\\kappa)=\\check\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f:S\\to\\kappa\\;\\left(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;(f^{-1}[\\{\\beta\\}]\\in U)\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land P_U=\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\\}\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in P_U\\;\\left(\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_U\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow s\\subseteq t\\land B\\subseteq A\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathbb P_U=\\langle P_U,\\leq_U\\rangle\\end{aligned}\\right]\\to\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}\\mathrm{cf}(\\check\\kappa)=\\check\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Prikry forcing changes the cofinality of a measurable cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> without adding bounded subsets.</li>\n<li>Used to construct models where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> becomes singular.</li>\n<li>The forcing conclusion is metatheoretic because this atom fixes the poset but does not supply a set-ground model parameter for an object-language forcing predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (measurable cardinal, see [[58-df-measurable]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)$ (normal $\\kappa$-complete nonprincipal ultrafilter, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}$ (measurable-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-measurable]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"P_U,\\leq_U,\\mathbb P_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}prikry} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\&\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\emptyset\\land|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\\\&\\land\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f:S\\to\\kappa\\;\\left(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)<\\alpha)\\to\\exists\\beta<\\kappa\\;(f^{-1}[\\{\\beta\\}]\\in U)\\right)\\\\&\\land P_U=\\{\\langle s,A\\rangle:s\\in\\kappa^{<\\omega}\\land A\\in U\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\;\\forall\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha<\\beta)\\}\\\\&\\land\\forall\\langle s,A\\rangle,\\langle t,B\\rangle\\in P_U\\;\\left(\\langle t,B\\rangle\\leq_U\\langle s,A\\rangle\\leftrightarrow s\\subseteq t\\land B\\subseteq A\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(t)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\subseteq A\\right)\\\\&\\land\\mathbb P_U=\\langle P_U,\\leq_U\\rangle\\end{aligned}\\right]\\to\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_U}\\mathrm{cf}(\\check\\kappa)=\\check\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2273,"backlinks":[{"id":"8939a496badbb7a7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-prikry.md|58-thm-prikry]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["109d01fe15884218","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}